  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "This document exists to be looked at. Every heading level from one to six appears below, each one immediately followed b",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "That gap is not hypothetical. No artifact in the previous evidence set rendered an h1, h3, h4, h5 or h6 at all, so the f",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "A section heading opens a part of the answer, and a reader skimming for the part they need should be able to find this l",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Three levels down is where model output actually lives: a numbered plan, a comparison, a set of options. The size step f",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the level the scale used to lose. It sat at exactly body size, at a weight an unclassed bold run beat outright, ",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Rare in real answers and common in generated outlines. It has to remain recognisable as a heading while being unmistakab",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The last level stops being a heading-by-size and becomes a label. It is the one that could otherwise be mistaken for the",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Vertical rhythm is half of a heading scale: space above a heading binds it to what follows and separates it from what ca",
      "whiteSpace": "normal",
      "fontSizePx": 15,
      "lineHeightPx": 24,
      "carriesSourceNewline": false,
      "hardBreaks": 0,
      "renderedLines": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Below the fold there is ordinary prose, long enough to measure a line against: a comfortable reading measure is sixty-fi",
